OL,3,ASecond storm to hit UK with more wind
OL,4,Aand rain as thousands remain without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe warning comes just one day after
OL,8,FStorm Austen unleashed wind gusts in
OL,9,Fexcess of 75mph, resulting in toppled
OL,10,Ftrees, transport disruption and
OL,11,Fthousands of power outages.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
